{
  "about": "#177 — when is an entry order final in an order listing refreshed this session (update_status)? One rule for the window bracket (src/lib/bracket-core.ts listingRowFinality) and the background engine (src-tauri execution/sidecar.rs row_evidence); both test suites read this file. working = may still fill; filled / ended = final; inconsistent = counts contradict each other, taken as no evidence. reports: a 2-lot entry driven by its order / deal reports in order — a successful Cancel report (op_code 00) comes from the exchange and closes the entry's remaining quantity; a failed or code-less Cancel and an UpdateQty (a reduction) leave it open; a fill after the close is counted but never protected (未受保護). closed = the entry is over; protected = lots the bracket protects; unprotected = lots after the close.",
